        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "金水相生格，陰宅同。金內水外貴多，福少；金星如出水短，水方為貴"
      },
      {
        "id": "book024-b000635-p000-fb3ae45050",
